  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of tangent at the point<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>R&nbsp;</mtext><mfenced> <mrow> <mtext>x</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>&nbsp;f</mtext><mfenced> <mtext>x</mtext> </mfenced></mrow> </mfenced><mtext> </mtext><mtext> </mtext><mtext>is,&nbsp;Y</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>&nbsp;f</mtext><mfenced> <mtext>x</mtext> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>f</mtext><mo>′</mo><mfenced> <mtext>x</mtext> </mfenced><mfenced> <mrow> <mtext>X</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>x</mtext></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br /><br />Coordinates of the point are&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br />The slope of the perpendicular line through <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></math> is<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">′</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is the differential equation."
